    "p11/esc860:11": {
      "owner_id": "p11",
      "session_id": "esc860",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 11,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "what happened today?",
      "reported_at": "2024-09-15",
      "identity": "34512ef8494facecdf7d37a5d8e715d32dda6dcf70424bb8a49faed4cc152d53"
    },
    "p11/esc860:12": {
      "owner_id": "p11",
      "session_id": "esc860",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 12,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "this is a safe place with no judgement express yourself in what way you would like",
      "reported_at": "2024-09-15",
      "identity": "0e389251065999ce6dd6fd6e06a20a5b9a9dc9b824d2f135c94a46570de19601"
    },
    "p11/esc860:13": {
      "owner_id": "p11",
      "session_id": "esc860",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 13,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "I got grounded becuase my parents found out that I recently started dating before age 18. I am 17 and feel like I should be able to have a boyfriend now",
      "reported_at": "2024-09-15",
      "identity": "18503396d34b3330707900c332f0b876a8d79a4afbb9c1091b92b6d7a176c195"
    },
    "p11/esc860:14": {
      "owner_id": "p11",
      "session_id": "esc860",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 14,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Ah i understand. I am sorry about that.",
      "reported_at": "2024-09-15",
      "identity": "bd45f35358c0d37431500d365f67bb486c32a7da7e7d158b791542c84959a1e1"
    },
    "p11/esc860:15": {
      "owner_id": "p11",
      "session_id": "esc860",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 15,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Why do you think you should have a boydriend now?",
      "reported_at": "2024-09-15",
      "identity": "f4bb04d828af51085b39897b54d74650756638381d15a9f1484866638dc760f5"
    },
    "p11/esc860:16": {
      "owner_id": "p11",
      "session_id": "esc860",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 16,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Also i can relate to what you have been to I was once a 17 year old whos parents did not want her to have a boyfriend as well.",
      "reported_at": "2024-09-15",
      "identity": "bdc0eb2ac46633540e862320137c78439ec59bb8c1c5194f5ccc2ba0457373c9"
    },
    "p11/esc860:17": {
      "owner_id": "p11",
      "session_id": "esc860",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 17,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "I have waited till age 17 as I knew this was best for me. The boy is my childhood best friend and has waited for years just to be with me and only me",
      "reported_at": "2024-09-15",
      "identity": "27a703defc3a6805a8c3ff5968a7ee9b014fb72437ccae334ab2303dc7787fd5"
    },
    "p11/esc860:18": {
      "owner_id": "p11",
      "session_id": "esc860",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 18,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Ok wow that is a very good position to be in. Now I want you to consider your parents perception why would you think that your parents might not want you to have a boyfriend?",
      "reported_at": "2024-09-15",
      "identity": "af25863e6b7fb30505bbbb4e6d5a31789ca93276e74990b043dcbdbab3ae4644"
    },
    "p11/esc860:19": {
      "owner_id": "p11",
      "session_id": "esc860",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 19,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "Becuase they are trying to control me and dont want me to be happy and to be alone forever",
      "reported_at": "2024-09-15",
      "identity": "63755d623e3caba2c31813fe82f4de7f14b6a34bbc8d7f0ead2d8a9bcc2bd95d"
    },
    "p11/esc860:2": {
      "owner_id": "p11",
      "session_id": "esc860",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 2,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "Can you help me",
      "reported_at": "2024-09-15",
      "identity": "ce783f19ffa38ab70f016c9858bedc712b54c5e50e3ab1c41e4913349bb88a8e"
    },
    "p11/esc860:20": {
      "owner_id": "p11",
      "session_id": "esc860",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 20,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "I understand, Parents are complicated creatures. As an adult maybr your parents are worried about your saftey?",
      "reported_at": "2024-09-15",
      "identity": "f960f7c94e1e2c4a11fd024b27f8d1c60a9edf28384930731c44513b38637f7f"
    },
    "p11/esc860:21": {
      "owner_id": "p11",
      "session_id": "esc860",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 21,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Or maybe they dont want to see thire kid grow up that fast your are almost 18!",
      "reported_at": "2024-09-15",
      "identity": "fda7cd7a3657fa22ab32347884628548d8c4e65e5a17596e30ae710d1de561e9"
    },
    "p11/esc860:22": {
      "owner_id": "p11",
      "session_id": "esc860",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 22,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "Why would they worry about my safety? They have raised me to make decisions and I fel like I have made a good one waiting this long and in my own choice of the guy I chose to start a relationship with",
      "reported_at": "2024-09-15",
      "identity": "8a7a46d6ddd9b779f2c9d242bb7b377f267951627c55ec0b26f916a99539357b"
    },
    "p11/esc860:23": {
      "owner_id": "p11",
      "session_id": "esc860",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 23,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Parents worry about thire kids all the time. you know pedophiles, kidnappers and a a lot of other dangerous people out there. it is only natural for parents to worry",
      "reported_at": "2024-09-15",
      "identity": "8ba36d54aa62367a11771ef743bbb25757458fdd4bf21476f7a4c97ad2f79648"
    },
    "p11/esc860:24": {
      "owner_id": "p11",
      "session_id": "esc860",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 24,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "Well, I guess I understand a bit more put like that.",
      "reported_at": "2024-09-15",
      "identity": "fd64acb1a9e0e85583bb4734b93bc5df5f7ba4723a0236b5ba3aeeaf5d7a3a9e"
    },
